<title>MEXICO: U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to July 10.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to July 10.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Soybean Association (ASA) updated Thursday, via its local office, U.S. exports of soybeans to Mexico to July 10.</p>
<p>The ASA said it sees &quot;another record year for soybeans to Mexico.&quot;</p>
<p>Volumes are in tonnes, accumulated week-on-week for the marketing year Sept 1 - Aug 31.</p>
<p>    Week Ending    Accum Total    Week Ending    Accum Total</p>
<p>    03/04/96	  1,489,000	02/04/97	 1,811,000</p>
<p>    10/04/96	  1,613,000	09/04/97	 1,875,000</p>
<p>    17/04/96	  1,652,000	16/04/97	 1,960,000</p>
<p>    24/04/96	  1,700,000	30/04/97	 2,159,000</p>
<p>    15/05/96	  1,886,000	14/05/97	 2,265,000</p>
<p>    13/06/96	  2,087,000	12/06/97	 2,490,000</p>
<p>    25/06/96	  2,204,000	25/06/97	 2,666,000</p>
<p>    10/07/96	  2,285,000	10/07/97	 2,759,000</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
